---
import Base from "../layouts/Base.astro";
---

<Base
  title="Open-source dental practice management"
  description="LibreDental is an open-source dental practice management system. Free to self-host, free to modify, free to share."
>
  <div class="wrap hero">
    <h1>Dental practice software that belongs to its users</h1>
    <p class="lead">
      LibreDental is an open-source dental practice management system. Run it on
      your own hardware, inspect every line of code, and adapt it to how your
      practice actually works.
    </p>
    <div class="hero-actions">
      <a class="button button-primary" href="/docs/">Read the docs</a>
      <a class="button button-secondary" href="/about/">About the project</a>
    </div>

    <div class="card-grid">
      <div class="card">
        <h3>Open source</h3>
        <p>
          The full source is public. Audit it, fork it, or contribute back —
          nothing is hidden behind a license server.
        </p>
      </div>
      <div class="card">
        <h3>Self-hosted</h3>
        <p>
          Your patient data stays on infrastructure you control. No vendor
          lock-in and no per-seat pricing.
        </p>
      </div>
      <div class="card">
        <h3>Community-driven</h3>
        <p>
          Features are shaped by the practices and developers who use the
          software, not by a sales roadmap.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="wrap">
    <hr />
    <h2>Getting started</h2>
    <p>
      Installation instructions, configuration reference, and upgrade notes live
      in the documentation.
    </p>
    <p><a href="/docs/getting-started/">Installation guide →</a></p>
  </div>
</Base>
